("nihon-sekkei","Nihon Sekkei","https://www.nihonsekkei.co.jp/en/","Nihon Sekkei is one of Japan's largest architecture and engineering firms, founded in Tokyo in 1967.","A red N built from diagonal stripes gives the firm a symbol that reads at any size.","Widely spaced capitals feel calm and precise next to the bold mark.",[("red N",0.04,0.15),("striped mark",0.04,0.9),("spaced caps",0.6,0.5)]),
