("pelli-clarke-and-partners","Pelli Clarke & Partners","https://pcparch.com/","Pelli Clarke & Partners was founded in 1977 by César Pelli and designed the Petronas Towers.","A light serif and a grey ampersand make the partner names elegant.","The full names stay in the logo, which feels personal.",[("light serif",0.12,0.15),("grey ampersand",0.62,0.9),("three names",0.88,0.15)]),
